<title>USA: Pioneer Co sets 7 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Co sets 7 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pioneer Cos Inc said on Monday that its board of directors declared a seven percent stock dividend to be paid on January 7, 1997 to shareholders of record December 16, 1996.</p>
<p>As of the end of September 30, 1996, the company had about 8.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
